[8.492742, "o", "gasket hopper layout\r\n====================\r\n\r\ngaskcli/boot.rs dispatches bind, jab, and cork.\r\n\r\nPipeline modules:\r\n- loomkit/  roster writer\r\n- rimcap/   compiled span\r\n- hopmat/   live hop table\r\n- lidpit/   seal writer\r\n- slipread/ card parse\r\n\r\nCards live in /app/buscards.\r\nbind refreshes /app/mistwell/roster.json and /app/loomkit/emit.lst.\r\ncork writes /app/corkbay/seal.json.\r\nFixture copies of the cards sit at /app/cardbak/buscards.\r\n\r\nRebuild the binary with /app/stoke.sh after source edits.\r\n"]
[8.492949, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@57e45bc159f9:/app# "]
